# Markdown is prose. Prettier's prose-wrap reflows it and turns a wrapped line that
# begins with "+"/"-"/"*" into a list item — silently mangling sentences in the docs
# for little benefit. Author markdown by hand; prettier stays on code, where it shines.
# MDX (help/blog articles in content/) is the same: hand-authored prose + first-party
# JSX components; keep prettier off it so inline components + frontmatter stay as written.
*.md
*.mdx
